  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Increase resilience and social cohesion amongst Moldova&apos;s vulnerable population in coping with the energy crisis.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The action is designed to limit the negative socioeconomic impact of Moldova&apos;s gas and energy crisis, thus preventing the deterioration into a socioeconomic crisis with the potential to lead to widespread social unrest. The main objective of the action is to contribute to maintaining the stability of the Republic of Moldova by mitigating the impact of the energy crisis on the most vulnerable parts of the population. To this end, PIN will implement a 16-month project covering the whole territory&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
